## Key Insights

- Revenue reached $109.81M with a profit of $12.55M and an 11.43% profit margin.
- Revenue and profit increased by 52.3% and 56.6% YoY respectively.
- Orders grew by 223.6% YoY, while Average Order Value declined by 52.9%.
- Bikes were the highest-performing product category by revenue.
- The United States and Australia were the top revenue-generating regions.
- Mountain-200 was the top-performing product by revenue.
- Road-650 generated significant revenue but operated at a loss, indicating a profitability concern.
